        <span id="pcl2-p1-title">نمودار <span dir="ltr">P-v</span>: سطح سمت چپ <span dir="ltr">(-∫ v dP)</span></span>
        <span dir="ltr" id="pcl2-p1-tag">Ratio = 552×</span>
